      "uid": "zhcn:afb33ab8abb7d55f1240be9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也没有不用功。只是为了狂怒乐章的成功，\n我已经付出了一切努力，才没有学习那些跟现在无关的知识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c0a939ec9859694c67426e03bb35f67ad8131a3ccc27a1ee6d8453eb4750f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
