      "uid": "zhcn:86a9a0b06fb11b48ea545e37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将我们的故乡船桥，变得更加热闹，\n更加闪耀的梦想……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "365eaf7a582df0ce6170fa79a0432c94350ef26e10103e5c3f020161638a0490",
