      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呐喊――将我拉回了梦想的原点。\n的确，要宣传船桥，必须是来自船桥的两个人才能实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a1988716cc17139950d911bf25c93c096f48c83d71019f185e15dec41b33e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
